    "paragraph": "The Behavior2Trip benchmark was established using 11,400 instances from a major Chinese online travel platform to enable personalized travel planning through user behavior trajectories. Another study developed a simulation paradigm that integrates physical mobility flows with social behavioral adaptation to evaluate the impacts of urban traffic regulations. Finally, the TEMPLAR Wales dataset compiled 3,757 georeferenced settlement records across Wales to link a reproducible settlement frame with lexical detections based on Welsh place-name elements.",
